                                "example_id": "52daee7f-fe25-4a4f-b2e7-15b7081b6e82",
                                "sense_id": "22854509-9a73-31ef-a95d-73492742b0fa",
                                "text": "He was a good Citizen, of an honest-gentle nature, as are commonly fat and burly men; for so was he: But to speake truely of him, full of ambitious vanitie and remisse nicenesse [translating mollesse]."
